  "operationsScope": "Ordinary browser keyboard gameplay. Test invokes thin native adapters: EldSaveLoad SaveMaster/TryLoadMaster, ReturnToHub native restart event, SDL_QUIT native shutdown. No position/objective injection. Save/restore/restart are not yet product UI controls.",
